# ==================================================================
# DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED - do not "tidy up" the entries below.
# ==================================================================
#
# data/
#   The daily snapshot workflow commits data/raw/YYYY-MM-DD.csv.gz back
#   into the repo. If data/ were ignored the workflow would silently
#   store nothing, and the loss would only surface days later.
#   See CLAUDE.md 6.3.
#
# public/data/
#   Generated JSON / GeoJSON consumed by the frontend. GitHub Pages
#   serves it as a static asset. Committed on purpose so the Pages deploy
#   is decoupled from the Python pipeline: a broken pipeline leaves the
#   site up with slightly stale data instead of failing the deploy.
#   See CLAUDE.md 4.1.
#
# ==================================================================
